# SDAIA Academy Portal

Training portal: Next.js 16 + Supabase + Vercel (`bom1`). Repo root is `portal/`
only — never touch or commit parent `_backups/` (PII).

## Before coding

Read `docs/CONTEXT.md`. For assessments also `docs/ASSESSMENTS.md` and
`docs/DATA-MODEL.md`. Architecture: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Deploy: `DEPLOY.md`.

## Do not break

- RLS + `course_id` on content tables; helpers in `app_private.*`
- Answer keys in `assessment_answer_keys` only — never on options
- Quiz trust in RPCs: `start_attempt`, `save_response`, `submit_attempt`, `record_integrity_event`
- Call `revalidateCourseContent(courseId)` after content mutations
- Keep `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` server-only (cache reader)
- Keep `vercel.json` regions `["bom1"]` unless Supabase moves
- Courses are 5 days; scores are quiz-only (no manual entry)

## Conventions

- Server Actions thin; atomic logic in Postgres
- Students: `published.ts` cache. Instructors: live `queries.ts` / `quiz.ts`
- Design: navy + teal accent, IBM Plex, no emoji / pill chrome / heavy shadows
- `'use server'` files export async functions only (no plain `export const`)
